+# Cache eviction policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LFU (least frequently used) cache for eviction, so that frequently accessed items stay resident; the stated rationale is that this fits the project's workload. No other eviction parameters, such as capacity or TTL, are recorded.
